027-self-enumeration-begins-in-four-states-house-to-house-count-from-december-1/articleshow/135892756.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135892756.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Census 2027 self-enumeration process has commenced in Uttar Pradesh, Punjab, Goa, and Uttarakhand, running until November 30. Following this, house-to-house enumeration will begin on December 1. The initiative aims to gather a range of data, including caste details from respondents, with an open-ended approach. Meanwhile, Manipur's census has been postponed due to local concerns regarding the national register of citizens.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/census-2027-self-enumeration-begins-in-four-states-house-to-house-count-from-december-1/articleshow/135892756.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/census-2027-self-enumeration-begins-in-four-states-house-to-house-count-from-december-1/articleshow/135892756.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-16T20:06:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Bharti Jain</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135893003,imgsize-175758.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[IISc researchers find antibiotic combination to reverse drug resistance in TB]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/iisc-researchers-find-antibiotic-combination-to-reverse-drug-resistance-in-tb/articleshow/135892833.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135892833.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/iisc-researchers-find-antibiotic-combination-to-reverse-drug-resistance-in-tb/articleshow/135892833.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.